<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 302-3 AT CLOSE V ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 302-3 AT CLOSE V ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 302 for three wickets at close of play on the first day of the fifth test against England at Trent Bridge on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 302-3 (M.Taylor 76, M.Elliott 69, M.Waugh 60 not out, G.Blewett 50) v England.</p>
